Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Twelve rows at a time go through one Strands Agents graph.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:08.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Preparer and the Reviewer are\Ntwo entry nodes, running in parallel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:14.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,Strands hands each only the rows, so the\NReviewer never sees the Preparer's reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.99,0:00:20.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Both call a real Strands tool that\Nreturns the IRS instruction text for a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:27.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here is the finished trace: five graph runs, ninety\Ntwo tool calls, counted by a Strands hook provider.
